OL,6,FSpoiler warning: This article reveals
OL,7,Fdetails from episode nine of The
OL,8,FCelebrity Traitors, series two.
OL,10,FFrom shock slip-ups to a murder by
OL,11,Fyawning - and a whole host of Jerry
OL,12,FHall one-liners along the way - the
OL,13,Fcurrent series of Celebrity Traitors
OL,14,Fhas gripped the nation. But ahead of
OL,15,FFriday's finale, what do former
OL,16,Fcontestants make of this season's crop
OL,17,Fof stars and who are they tipping to
OL,18,Fwin?
OL,20,F"Maya has played a damn good game",
OL,21,F61-year-old Judy Wilson says.
